The remainder of the paper proceeds as follows. \S\ref{sec:prelim} fixes notation and reviews the \cpi{} framework on the running example of Figure~\ref{fig:overview}. \S\ref{sec:immutable}, \S\ref{sec:local}, \S\ref{sec:treefree}, and \S\ref{sec:peel} develop the immutability invariant and the three algorithms it unlocks. \S\ref{sec:exp} reports performance, \S\ref{sec:casestudy} the case studies, \S\ref{sec:related} related work, and \S\ref{sec:conclusion} closes with future directions enabled by the local algorithm.

