$(2,10)$        & $\phantom{0}49$ & $293$ & $\phantom{0\,\,}319$  & $10.3\times$ \\
$(3,10)$        & $\phantom{0}49$ & $293$ & $2{,}093$              & $67.5\times$ \\
\midrule
$(1,15)$        & $\phantom{0}0^{\dagger}$ & $173$ & $\phantom{0\,\,\,\,\,}9$ & --- \\
$(2,15)$        & $\phantom{0}0^{\dagger}$ & $173$ & $\phantom{0\,\,\,}55$  & $\phantom{0}6.2\times$  \\
